  'bikur cholim montreal': ['bikur cholim', 'bikkur cholim', '\u05d1\u05d9\u05e7\u05d5\u05e8 \u05d7\u05d5\u05dc\u05d9\u05dd'],
  'chai lifeline montreal': ['chai lifeline', 'chailifeline'],
